  "body": "Discover modern living at its best at 28 Mita Road, Silverdale! Brand new and ready for its very first owners, this spacious standalone home offers the perfect combination of comfort, convenience and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, growing family or savvy investor, this is an opportunity worth exploring!\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• 214sqm (approx.) standalone freehold section – no body corporate fees.\r\n• 173sqm (approx.) floor area across two levels.\r\n• 4 spacious bedrooms, ideal for families or working from home.\r\n• 2.5 modern bathrooms, including a master ensuite.\r\n• 2 separate living areas offering flexibility for the whole family.\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area.\r\n• Private outdoor deck, perfect for entertaining and summer BBQs.\r\n• Brand-new construction with modern finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nConvenient Silverdale Location:\r\n• Close to Silverdale Park & Ride for easy bus connections to Auckland CBD.\r\n• Minutes to Silverdale Centre, supermarkets, cafes and local amenities.\r\n• Convenient access to schools, parks and recreational facilities.\r\n• Easy motorway access for commuting.\r\n\r\nA Fantastic Opportunity – Don't Miss Out!\r\n\r\nEnjoy the benefits of brand-new freehold ownership, generous living space and a convenient location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit our next open home!",
